{"t_ms": 3235171, "conversation_id": "conv_sentence_end_s3_024", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Coffee Shop Information\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nThe hotel's coffee shop, Brew Lounge, is open daily from 8:00 AM to 11:00 PM. Guests can enjoy freshly brewed coffee, tea, pastries, sandwiches, desserts, and light snacks. Complimentary Wi-Fi and comfortable seating make it an ideal place for informal meetings or relaxation throughout the day.", "# corpus/ \u2014 Hotel Documents\n\n**Owner: Lakshya**\n\n## What this folder is\n\nThe hotel's documents live here: the knowledge the assistant answers from. About 60 short \ndocuments covering things like pool and gym hours, check-in and check-out rules, menus, and \npolicies.\n\n## How to fill it\n\nSee the full instructions in `retrieval/README.md` (Step 1). In short:\n- Write ~60 short documents, one topic per file, as `.txt` or `.md`.\n- Make them realistic and varied.\n- Deliberately plant a few contradictions (e.g. one doc says the pool closes at 10 PM, \n  another says 9 PM) and keep a note of which ones, for a later experiment.\n\nThe index-building script reads every file in this folder, so anything you put here becomes \npart of the searchable knowledge.\n", "Business Centre Services\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nThe Business Centre is open daily from 8:00 AM to 8:00 PM. Facilities include desktop computers, high-speed internet access, printing, scanning, photocopying, and meeting workstations. Guests requiring administrative assistance may request support from the Business Centre staff during operating hours."], "scores": [0.5533286333084106, 0.7467018961906433, 0.8428655862808228], "timing_policy": "sentence_end", "timing_trigger": "sentence_end", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 1344, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
